{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北京市委常委、副市長夏林茂涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，正接受中紀委紀律審查和監察調查。</p><p></p><p>56歲夏林茂，是江蘇建湖人。2008年起，先後出任北京市規劃委副主任、北京市委辦公室副主任等職務。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Mju2C9rQDr1792662395.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>2021年起出任北京市委常委，2023年起就任北京副市長。他目前是二十屆中央候補委員、十四屆全國人大代表。今年5月時夏林茂曾經在北京，出席國家十五五規劃北京專場新聞發布會。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:04.625490+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:37.548848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:37.548848+00:00","content_hash":"1d169cd8899b61fb2cb84f20fdf2d396e717347cf3e4b487494efd3956529fc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}